    # "Both me and 马库斯 waited in position in our {i}‘other’{/i} forms as we listened out for the loud whizzing sounds of the fire sticks."
    "我和马库斯以{i}「另一种」{/i}形态就位，凝神等待着焰火棒的呼啸声。"

